@startuml Teacher's Teammate — Layers
top to bottom direction

skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowColor #333333
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #888888
}
skinparam rectangle<<adapter>> {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
}
skinparam rectangle<<inner>> {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #388E3C
}

rectangle "**gui/**  ·  **cli.py**\nadapters: no discovery, no availability logic" as ADAPT <<adapter>>
rectangle "**application/**\nthe services; the only entry for the adapters" as APP
rectangle "**infrastructure/**\nOCR engines, LLM providers, stores, DOCX, workflow" as INFRA
rectangle "**texts/**\nevery sentence a teacher reads" as TEXTS
rectangle "**core**\nconfig · interfaces · cache_keys · run_rules · settings_schema" as CORE
rectangle "**domain/**\npure rules, no I/O" as DOMAIN <<inner>>
rectangle "**pkg**\nexceptions · messages" as PKG <<inner>>

ADAPT --> APP
ADAPT --> CORE
ADAPT --> TEXTS
APP --> INFRA
APP --> CORE
INFRA --> CORE
INFRA --> TEXTS
CORE --> DOMAIN
TEXTS --> DOMAIN
DOMAIN --> PKG

rectangle "composition modules\ngui/composition.py · gui/__main__.py · gui/benchmark/composition.py ·\ngui/benchmark/__main__.py · cli_composition.py · __main__.py ·\nfrozen_entry.py · frozen_modes.py" as COMP #FFF3E0
COMP .down.> INFRA : the only adapter modules\nthat import infrastructure

legend right
  An arrow reads "may import".
  Not drawn: every layer may also import ""domain"" and ""pkg"".
  ""application"" does not import ""texts""; ""domain"" imports only ""pkg"".
  Guarded by ""tests/unit/test_layer_imports.py"".
endlegend

@enduml
